 </section>\n </header>\n <div data-elementor-type=\"single-post\" data-elementor-id=\"119\" class=\"elementor elementor-119 elementor-location-single post-2189 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-activities category-blog category-events category-events-and-clubs tag-community-activities tag-community-event tag-events-calendar tag-farmers-market tag-featured tag-fund tag-hawaiian-culture tag-live-entertainment tag-live-music tag-north-shore tag-princeville tag-princeville-events tag-yoga\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n <section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-55348d0 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"55348d0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n <div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"></div>\n <div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n <div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-440ea73\" data-id=\"440ea73\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n <div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n <div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32474f16 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"32474f16\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-title.default\">\n <div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n <h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">New Princeville and North Shore Events Calendar 2026</h1> </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f36fa38 elementor-icon-list--layout-inline elementor-align-center elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"f36fa38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n <div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n <ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items elementor-inline-items\">\n <li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n <a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/\">\n <span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">iHeartPrinceville</span>\n </a>\n </li>\n <li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n <a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/events-and-clubs/princeville-events-calendar/\">\n <span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i> </span>\n <span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\"><span>Activities</span>, <span>Blog</span>, <span>Events</span>, <span>Events &amp; Clubs</span></span>\n </a>\n </li>\n <li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n <a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/events-and-clubs/princeville-events-calendar/\">\n <span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i> </span>\n <span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">New Princeville and North Shore Events Calendar 2026</span>\n </a>\n </li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </section>\n <section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7c49de74 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7c49de74\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n <div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n <div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-67f4c385\" data-id=\"67f4c385\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n <div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n <div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9246d34 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9246d34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n <div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17c40519 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-id=\"17c40519\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\n <div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n <h2>Princeville Events Calendar 2026 (<a href=\"http://www.iheartprinceville.com\">Princeville</a> and other spots on the North Shore)</h2>\n<p>Two lists. First the weekly / reoccurring events and secondly the annual / one-off events.</p>\n<p>For residents looking to attend specific community activities such Bridge, Yoga, Dance Classes, AA meetings, Pet Loss Support Group, etc. in the Princeville Community Center visit their <a href=\"https://www.princevillecommunity.com/view/community-center-calendar.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">online site</a> for specific details, venues and times.</p>\n<p>If you are aware of events that could be listed on the Princeville Events Calendar, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.org\">someone@example.org</a>. The Princeville Events Calendar is updated regularly.</p>\n<h2>Princeville Events / Hanalei Events / Kilahuea Events<br>\nSection 1: Weekly or Reoccurring Events</h2>\n<p><strong>Ahi Lele Fire Show </strong><em>(every Wednesday. Additional Friday showings June – August)<br>\n</em>Polynesian fire dance and drum show providing a journey through Hawaiian culture and history.<br>\nTime: Starts at 6:00PM with dinner Luau box, the coconut pre-show starts at 7:00PM and the fire show begins at 7:30pm.<br>\nWhere: Open-air Porter Pavilion (Seats are set up in pods of 2 – 5 seats.)<br>\n<a href=\"https://anainahou.org/ahi-lele-fire-show/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">For more information.</a><br>\nEntrance: <a href=\"https://anainahou.org/ahi-lele-fire-show/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ticket purchases</a><br>\nKama’aina rates&nbsp;available for residents.</p>\n<p><strong>Anaina Hou Lanai Live Entertainment </strong><em>(almost every day)<br>\n</em>Live music or trivia night depending on day.<br>\nWhere: The Lanai at Anaina Hou Community Park<br>\n<a href=\"https://anainahou.org/lanai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">For more information.</a></p>\n<p><strong>Anaina Hou Farmers Market </strong><em>(every Saturday)<br>\n</em>Some 40 artisans and vendors provide local produces, fish, juices, meals, baked goods, crafts and music.<br>\nTime: 9:00AM – 12:00PM<br>\nWhere: Anaina Hou Community Park<br>\n<a href=\"https://anainahou.org/farmers-market/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">For more information.</a></p>\n<p><strong>Grow Aloha Plant Giveaway </strong><em>(3<sup>rd</sup> Saturday of every month)<br>\n</em>Time: 9:00AM – 12:00PM<br>\nWhere: Limahuli Garden &amp; Preserve<br>\nWhen we grow Hawaiian native plants and heritage crops, we grow aloha for <strong>ʻ</strong><strong>āina</strong><strong>. </strong>Adopt one of these cherished plants at the National Tropical Botanical Garden locations on Kauaʻi. Grow Aloha plant adoptions are free and open to Hawai’i residents (one per family). Please note that plants are subject to availability and will be distributed on a first-come, first-served basis.<br>\n<a href=\"https://ntbg.org/event/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">For more information.</a></p>\n<p><strong>Hanalei Farmers Market&nbsp;</strong><em>(every Saturday)<br>\n</em>Large produce market, with grown fruits &amp; vegetables, food artisans, and handmade crafts. Various tasty treats highlighting the culinary talents of the local area.<br>\nTime: 9:00AM – 12:00PM<br>\nWhere: Hale Halawai, Hanalei<br>\n<a href=\"https://halehalawai.org/farmers-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">For more information.</a></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3656\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3656\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3656\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Princeville Events Calendar</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3657\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3657\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3657\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">North Shore Events Calendar</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Princeville Events Calendar for 2025 – Section 2: Annual or One-off Events</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4885\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4885\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4885\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ohana Fitfest</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mceTemp\"></div>\n<h3>North North Events Calendar General</h3>\n<h3></h3>\n<div id=\"link-whisper-related-posts-widget\" class=\"link-whisper-related-posts lwrp\">\n <h3 class=\"lwrp-title\">Related Posts</h3> \n <div class=\"lwrp-list-container\">\n <div class=\"lwrp-list-multi-container\">\n <ul class=\"lwrp-list lwrp-list-double lwrp-list-left\">\n <li class=\"lwrp-list-item\"><a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/emergency-info/hurricane-resources/\" class=\"lwrp-list-link\"><span class=\"lwrp-list-link-title-text\">Hurricane Resources and Emergency Planning Guides</span></a></li><li class=\"lwrp-list-item\"><a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/kauai-hawaii/princeville-golf-tournament/\" class=\"lwrp-list-link\"><span class=\"lwrp-list-link-title-text\">Princeville Hosts Lions Golf Tournament ~</span></a></li><li class=\"lwrp-list-item\"><a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/blog/9th-annual-ohana-fit-fest-october-1st/\" class=\"lwrp-list-link\"><span class=\"lwrp-list-link-title-text\">9th Annual Ohana Fit Fest – Photos Available Sunday Evening</span></a></li><li class=\"lwrp-list-item\"><a href=\"https://iheartprinceville.com/activities/na-pali-coast-kauais-most-iconic-natural-wonder/\" class=\"lwrp-list-link\"><